OL,3,GNEWSANo Scotland, no festa - Italian
OL,4,Atown celebrates Caledonian connections
OL,5,
OL,6,FA small Italian town has attracted
OL,7,Fthousands of visitors to a three-day
OL,8,Fcelebration of its long-standing links
OL,9,Fto Scotland.
OL,11,FBarga in Tuscany held its annual
OL,12,FScottish weekend from Friday until
OL,13,FSunday.
OL,15,FPipe bands took to the streets, dancers
OL,16,Fperformed and a Highland games was held
OL,17,Fas part of the festivities.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
