OL,3,GNEWSANo Scotland, no festa - Italian
OL,4,Atown celebrates Caledonian connections
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarga has been described as the most
OL,7,FScottish town in Italy due to the
OL,8,Fnumber of emigrants who headed to
OL,9,FScotland at the beginning of the 20th
OL,10,FCentury and between the two world wars
OL,11,Fbut retained links with Tuscany.
